    "created_at": "2016-08-05T00:08:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-05T00:08:14Z",
    "body": "Yeah, `requestDevice()` is a new kind of interface that lots of people won't be familiar with. We're doing it this way so that we can present users a choice of devices to grant access to, instead of making it a yes/no decision for just the device the site wants. We think that'll have better security properties, although we don't have good evidence for that yet.\n\nWe do want to add things to the chooser to make it easy to distinguish multiple nearby mice. We're currently adding a note in the Chrome chooser to identify devices that have already been paired, but I think we should add another one for devices that are physically connected.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
